      "text": "Oh, yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah, oh, I am not dumb, a kid in a door, every time I'm all up in, a woman laughs hard at the end of the block, the river wears them on like a cheap silver ring, and the bridges keepin' talkin' to shocks,",
